@scenario project_board
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[if !tutorial_count]
[set tutorial_count 0]
[endif]
[show pip desk wave]
@label board
pip: What would you like to work on today?
> Opening and timing -> topics_page_1
> Sound and direction -> topics_page_2
> Scene craft -> topics_page_3
> Production desk -> topics_page_4
> Tools and lighting -> topics_page_5
> Rehearsal and release -> topics_page_6
> Progress and motion -> options
@label options
pip: You have logged ${tutorial_count} of 30 lessons. You can revisit any of them.
> Use reduced motion -> still
> Play character and camera moves -> motion
> Back to the board -> board
@label still
[flag tutorial_still]
[set ui.reduceMotion true]
[jump board]
@label motion
[set tutorial_still false]
[set ui.reduceMotion false]
[jump board]
@label topics_page_1
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: Start with a line of dialogue or a change of scene.
> First words -> open_dialogue
> Leave a beat -> open_narration
> Read the room -> open_expressions
> Set the stage -> open_images
> Change scenes -> open_transitions
> Back to the board -> board
@label topics_page_2
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: Pick something to put in motion.
> Welcome chime -> open_audio
> Remember a choice -> open_variables
> Find a mark -> open_movement
> Animate the office -> open_puppeteer
> Offer a choice -> open_menus
> Back to the board -> board
@label topics_page_3
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: Choose a scene to direct.
> Reuse a sound -> open_subroutines
> Find the first bad beat -> open_best_practices
> Frame the equipment -> open_camera
> Translate a cue -> open_localization
> Design for the reader -> open_ui_layout
> Back to the board -> board
@label topics_page_4
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: Which part of the game shall we test?
> Test a packaged game -> open_testing_release
> Visit the project board -> open_vns_jes
> Try an image effect -> open_plugins_and_line_boil
> Resume a saved shift -> open_saves_rollback_persistence
> Change the voice -> open_dialogue_presentation
> Back to the board -> board
@label topics_page_5
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: Choose a tool for the office.
> Watch a live value -> open_reactive_ui_and_facets
> Take a message -> open_phone_storytelling
> Leave room for effects -> open_particles_and_visualizers
> Light the night shift -> open_layer_groups_and_lighting
> Build a desk widget -> open_jes_entities_input_widgets
> Back to the board -> board
@label topics_page_6
[bg office]
[show pip desk point]
pip: What needs attention before we ship?
> Separate space from physics -> open_jes_worlds_physics_rpg
> Find the right source -> open_editor_workflows
> Budget the frame -> open_assets_and_performance
> Play with less motion -> open_accessibility_and_controls
> Sign off -> open_java_extensions_and_capstone
> Back to the board -> board
@label open_dialogue
[goto T01_Dialogue:start]
@label open_narration
[goto T02_Narration:start]
@label open_expressions
[goto T03_Expressions:start]
@label open_images
[goto T04_Images:start]
@label open_transitions
[goto T05_Transitions:start]
@label open_audio
[goto T06_Audio:start]
@label open_variables
[goto T07_Variables:start]
@label open_movement
[goto T08_Movement:start]
@label open_puppeteer
[goto T09_Puppeteer:start]
@label open_menus
[goto T10_Menus:start]
@label open_subroutines
[goto T11_Subroutines:start]
@label open_best_practices
[goto T12_BestPractices:start]
@label open_camera
[goto T13_Camera:start]
@label open_localization
[goto T14_Localization:start]
@label open_ui_layout
[goto T15_UILayout:start]
@label open_testing_release
[goto T16_TestingRelease:start]
@label open_vns_jes
[goto T17_VnsJes:start]
@label open_plugins_and_line_boil
[goto T18_Plugins:start]
@label open_saves_rollback_persistence
[goto T19_Saves:start]
@label open_dialogue_presentation
[goto T20_Presentation:start]
@label open_reactive_ui_and_facets
[goto T21_Facets:start]
@label open_phone_storytelling
[goto T22_Phone:start]
@label open_particles_and_visualizers
[goto T23_Particles:start]
@label open_layer_groups_and_lighting
[goto T24_Stage:start]
@label open_jes_entities_input_widgets
[goto T25_JesTools:start]
@label open_jes_worlds_physics_rpg
[goto T26_JesWorlds:start]
@label open_editor_workflows
[goto T27_Editor:start]
@label open_assets_and_performance
[goto T28_Assets:start]
@label open_accessibility_and_controls
[goto T29_Accessibility:start]
@label open_java_extensions_and_capstone
[goto T30_Extensions:start]
